{"synopsis":"Pada hari yang menentukan itu, Chrono Gaius, Pendekar Pedang Terkuat di dunia, kehilangan segalanya.\n\nDia terpaksa menyaksikan musuh bebuyutannya mengubah istri tercintanya dan bawahan setianya menjadi mayat hidup yang mengerikan.&#x20;\n\nChrono sendiri menemui akhir yang pahit dan menyakitkan—atau begitulah yang ia pikirkan. Ketika ia membuka matanya, ia menemukan dirinya telah bereinkarnasi ke dalam tubuh putra bungsu yang tidak kompeten dari pria yang membunuhnya!\n\nKini terperangkap dalam wadah terlemah, Chrono menyimpan kekuatan terlarang yang memungkinkannya untuk sementara melampaui bahkan masa jayanya di masa lalu.&#x20;\n\nMenyembunyikan identitas aslinya, ia harus berperan sebagai putra yang penyayang sambil menunggu waktu yang tepat untuk menyerang.\n\nMerangkak kembali dari jurang keputusasaan, kisah balas dendam yang luar biasa dimulai sekarang!","alternative_title":"ピッコマ｜無料漫画・小説、新作コミックが毎日楽しめる！","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"ch_22","number":"22","chapter":"22","title":"Chapter 22","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_21","number":"21","chapter":"21","title":"Chapter 21","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_20","number":"20","chapter":"20","title":"Chapter 20","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_19","number":"19","chapter":"19","title":"Chapter 19","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_18","number":"18","chapter":"18","title":"Chapter 18","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_17","number":"17","chapter":"17","title":"Chapter 17","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_16","number":"16","chapter":"16","title":"Chapter 16","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ch_15","number":"15","chapter":"15","title":"Chapter 15","date":"2026-08-03","released":"20